Subject: [PATCH 126/126] go.mod: sing-vmess of the fork with the Vision buffer
 fix of upstream

v0.2.8-pdk13.3 adds upstream 40a1d62: in the padding phase of Vision a write
of 8171 bytes or more is cut into as many parts as it takes, not into exactly
two, of which one could be longer than a frame is meant to carry. The 1.14
line has it through sing-vmess v0.2.8.
---
 go.mod | 2 +-
 go.sum | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index afacb30d5..ef020918e 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -166,6 +166,6 @@ require (
 	gopkg.in/yaml.v3 v3.0.1 // indirect
 )
 
